    "defaultOnTools": 156,
    "defaultOnSchemaCharacters": 127423,
    "note": "A fresh install mounts every row whose component default is on. defaultOnTools is exact: one more default-on tool fails the suite until the count is raised here with its measurement, or the component ships off. Measured 2026-11-14 after optix_screen and optix_design_check landed: l5x 54 + ftview 51 + mwi 24 + optix 18 (17 vendored engine tools plus optix_netlogic, which entries/netlogic.js registers) + engineering-resources 2 + migration 7 = 156 (ecad 12 and plc5 8 ship off). defaultOnSchemaCharacters is the measured 122522 characters of the default-on generated definitions plus a 4% allowance for wording changes; ECAD (12 tools) ships off and is excluded, and the Optix tools are not generated from source and are bounded by the tool count instead."
  },
  "skillPolicy": {
    "defaultBudget": 8000,
    "note": "A skill body is injected into the request when the skill is invoked, so the budget is a context-cost ceiling. Depth belongs in docs/ and is linked, not embedded. The tested pair cost is the sum of two product bodies: l5x 10265 + ftview 7975 = 18240 characters (about 4.6k tokens), so a workflow skill must stay near 3k to keep a three-skill load near 6k."
  },
